","id":4390136703,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBawrfw","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-06T16:37:45Z","updated_at":"2026-05-06T16:37:45Z","body":"This is reproducible in 4.6.2 and even in 4.4.1, it is not a regression.\nIs your 4.6.2 in single window mode?\n\nAdditionally the escape part applies to all tooltips, see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104205\nSo the fix for that should be applicable to all tooltips.\nThe same goes for alt+tab.\n\nTyping and moving the caret also applies to regular TextEdit and LineEdit tooltips as well.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4390136703/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4396151358","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119213#issuecomment-4396151358","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119213","id":4396151358,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBgfyPg","user":{"login":"duianto","id":13420573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDIwNTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13420573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/duianto","html_url":"https://github.com/duianto","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duianto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duianto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duianto/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duianto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duianto/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duianto/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duianto/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duianto/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duianto/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-07T10:04:17Z","updated_at":"2026-05-07T10:17:58Z","body":"> Is your 4.6.2 in single window mode?\n\nYes, single window mode was enabled in v4.6.2.stable.official [71f334935]\n\nThe same behavior is observed in both:\n- v4.7.beta1.official [1c8cc9e7e]\n- v4.6.2.stable.official [71f334935]\n\nIssue occurs when single window mode is disabled (default)\nThe script editor's mouse over popup doesn't stay closed.\n\nExpected occurs when single window mode is enabled\nThe script editor's mouse over popup stays closed.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4396151358/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]